			"notes": "Introducing 2.0.0 beta of Crimson Moon, which completely revamps the mod. Introducing...\n   - Awesome new effects for the start of a Crimson Moon\n   - Better mob spawning logic \n   - Scaling mob difficulty based on your game progression\n   - Hugely increased mob range detection during events to increase the difficulty\n   - A set of awesome themed tools you can craft with loot from the event\n   - An entirely revamped internal API that includes events for other mods to hook into\n   - Lots of bug fixes and thematic tweaks\n\nThis is a potentially unstable beta release, and additions are subject to change. \n\nCrimson Moon bundles Satin, which is licensed under LGPLv3. You can find the source code of Satin [here](https://github.com/Ladysnake/Satin)."
		},
